---
import Layout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
export const prerender = false;
---
<Layout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE.title}`}
  description={`How ${SITE.name} handles your data, cookies, analytics, and advertising.`}
>
  <nav class="breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">Home</a> › <span>Privacy Policy</span>
  </nav>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p>Last updated: 27 September 2026</p>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.name} ("we", "us") handles information
    when you use {SITE.url}.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>
    You can browse this site without an account. We do not ask for your name,
    phone number, or address. Our searches run on our own infrastructure; the
    search term itself is not tied to your identity.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We use minimal cookies only where a feature needs them (for example,
    remembering your last search or your feedback choice). You can block cookies
    in your browser — the directory pages will still work.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    We use privacy-respecting analytics to understand which pages are useful.
    Our analytics providers are:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Ahrefs Web Analytics</strong> — does not use cookies and does not
      collect or store personal data. It counts page views, referrers and
      countries in aggregate only. See
      <a href="https://ahrefs.com/traffic/privacy" rel="noopener">Ahrefs' privacy policy</a>.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Analytics</strong> — uses cookies to report aggregate
      traffic data such as page views and referrers.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    This data is not used to personally identify you.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We may show ads served by third-party networks, including Google AdSense.
    These networks may use cookies (including the Google advertising cookie) to
    serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites.
    Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads
    based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>You may opt out of personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="noopener">Google Ads Settings</a></li>
    <li>For more, see <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener">Google's advertising policies</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>5. Third-party links</h2>
  <p>
    Our pages link to official sources such as India Post and state portals.
    We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those external sites.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    This site is a general information directory and does not knowingly collect
    any data from children under 13.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the site evolves. The date at the top always
    shows the latest version. Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.
  </p>
</Layout>
